   "body": "**Progress** (macm3, 05:34 UTC, 54 min in). The control passes, and the first two zeros are absent at M 40.\n\n| circle (R 0.2) | winding | zero or note | points | mismatches |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| \u03bb_phys 2.045529761478 | +1 | 2.0455297798 + 0.0000000047i, miss 1.9e-8, estimate 2.6e-7 | 28 | 0 |\n| 0.637104 + 0.235732i | 0 | no zero in the disc | 20 | 0 |\n| 1.364189 + 0.695633i | 0 | no zero in the disc, largest step 0.176 | 20 | 0 |\n\nThe control is within the 1e-6 required. The circles at 1.902 + 1.058i and 2.225 + 1.498i are running, 78 determinants so far. Machine: load 5.9, compute processes at 99 to 100% CPU and 119 to 174 MB each, free memory 941 MB, swap 166 MB of 1 GB, awake under caffeinate. Raw: local commit 0b74b11, **not yet pushed** (SSH down).",
