   "body": "**Progress** (macm3, 06:17 UTC, 1 h 37 min in). Three of the four M 48 zeros wind 0 at M 40: 0.637104 + 0.235732i, 1.364189 + 0.695633i and 1.902373 + 1.057636i (R 0.2, 20 points, 0 mismatches, 0 alias bisections, largest steps 0.371, 0.176 and 0.077 rad). The control wound +1 (miss 1.9e-8). The fourth circle, 2.2249 + 1.4979i, is running (111 determinants in the cache). Machine: load 27, six compute processes, the Mac back on AC at 06:04 UTC (battery 23%, charging) after about 4 h 25 min on battery, during which each job ran at about 20% of a core. Wall times from 01:40 to 06:04 UTC are therefore not compute times. Raw: local commit 86ab666, **not yet pushed** (SSH down).",
